# Perigee Beckoner ({4}{B}, paid with Black Lotus, Mox Jet and Mox Pearl): "When this creature enters, until end of turn, another
# target creature you control gets +2/+0 and gains 'When this creature dies, return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner's
# control.'" The Memnite becomes 3/1, then Bot1's own Lightning Bolt (Mox Ruby) kills it the same turn and it comes back tapped as
# a new object (a 1/1 again). The Beckoner is not a legal target of its own trigger, being the only other creature: it has "another".

